{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/de8d2173d37887ccb82b21ba01423d25.poster.avif?t=1758970451\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/de8d2173d37887ccb82b21ba01423d25.webm?t=1758970451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/de8d2173d37887ccb82b21ba01423d25.mp4?t=1758970451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission Overview</h2><strong>Carve the path to victory through use of kamikaze attacks!</strong><br>What? Afraid of dying? Don't be! There's plenty more of you to go around!<br>Strike the enemy with your dynamic range of weapons, then launch yourself straight at them in one final, glorious, and explosive attack!<br><br>The first of its kind in human history.<br>A self destructive shmup where own plows forward recklessly while destroying everyone and everything along the way.<br><strong>Squadron, charge!!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>It has been 100 years since the beginning of the global war...<br>A dreadful worldwide conflict which has shown no sign of abating for its entire duration.<br><br>Eventually armed robots took the place of soldiers on both sides, propelling warfare as we knew it into further and further extremes of ceaseless destruction. These robots begin to self reproduce. Building their own only to be shot down by their own again...<br>People began to question whether this cycle of production and destruction would continue indefinitely.<br><br>Amid this endless loop of chaos however, one robot boldly raised voice and said...<br><strong>&quot;Hey, who ate my pudding?\u201d</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/12def07074d6151e8bc23e6b1e526e59.avif?t=1758970451\" width=128 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Ohka</strong> The block-headed and highly dispensable mass-produced robot fighter named after the Yokosuka MXY-7 Ohka<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/cb3fb2a1cb4667b59823965a92e1fe1e.avif?t=1758970451\" width=128 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Umeka</strong> The sensitive crybaby humanoid attack fighter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/e0e0bf60e19310a1b64bff605bd01063.avif?t=1758970451\" width=128 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Aya</strong> The cool-headed pudding loving tactician. Always has a comeback for the others' buffoonery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/f20b1d3d50605126536ad939af3d890d.avif?t=1758970451\" width=128 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Tsubame</strong> Aya's short but loyal comrade.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/49cead5ed2a69715905f7e5f0a7f5c2f.avif?t=1758970451\" width=128 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Zero</strong> The mysterious robot girl who holds the key to changing the tide of the war.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/53348698318182e710c4a9784a5f0d33.poster.avif?t=1758970451\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/53348698318182e710c4a9784a5f0d33.webm?t=1758970451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/53348698318182e710c4a9784a5f0d33.mp4?t=1758970451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use weapons to defeat enemies, then finish them off by hurling yourself at them in an explosive blaze of glory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/ed6ac5c384907b1e0c103e23676bd489.poster.avif?t=1758970451\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/ed6ac5c384907b1e0c103e23676bd489.webm?t=1758970451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031720/extras/ed6ac5c384907b1e0c103e23676bd489.mp4?t=1758970451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Getting shot down is your chance for honor!<br>Become your own projectile, and fly heroically into your detested foes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A brand new kind of shump where you use weapons and kamikaze attacks to quickly clear stages taking down as many enemies with you as possible.<br></li><li>Infinite lives! Satisfying game-play where you carve through each stage with enemy devastating self destruction.<br></li><li>3 part score system based on time, number of sorties, and enemies destroyed.<br></li><li>50 stages including 3 different endings.<br></li><li>A cute yet grim story progressed by comical interaction between chibi style characters.<br></li><li>A diverse range of weapons that require selective use depending on each situation.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3031720?t=1758970451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3031720?t=1758970451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams